//
// # References
//
//   - J. W. Tukey (1977). Exploratory Data Analysis. Addison-Wesley.
//   - R `bxp()`: https://stat.ethz.ch/R-manual/R-devel/library/graphics/html/bxp.html
//
// Parameters:
//
//   - position: Box center, in x data units.
//   - whiskerLo: Lower whisker end.
//   - q1: Lower box edge (first quartile).
//   - median: Median line.
//   - q3: Upper box edge (third quartile).
//   - whiskerHi: Upper whisker end.
//
// It returns this plot, for chaining.
//
// It uses the C++ defaults outliers = the zero value, color, width = 0.6; [RPlot.BoxWithOutliers],
// [RPlot.BoxWithColor] and [RPlot.BoxWithWidth] pass more arguments.
//
// See also boxplot().
