//
// Parameters:
//
//   - function: Objective to minimise.
//   - lower: Lower corner of the box.
//   - upper: Upper corner of the box (each entry larger than in `lower`).
//   - surrogate: Surrogate refitted before every proposal.
//
// It returns the evaluations and the best point.
//
// The error is an [*Error] of kind:
//
//   - [InvalidArgument] (C++ std::invalid_argument): If the bounds are empty, differ in length or
//     are not increasing.
