// The error is an [*Error] of kind:
//
//   - [InvalidArgument] (C++ std::invalid_argument): RMSProp: step_size must be positive; RMSProp:
//     decay_rate must be in [0, 1); RMSProp: epsilon must be positive; RMSProp: tolerance must be
//     non-negative.
