//
//   - [InvalidArgument] (C++ std::invalid_argument): For invalid data/knots or zero-width combined
//     domain.
//   - [NativeError] (C++ std::runtime_error): If every candidate system fails numerically.
//
// See also [PSplineRegression], gcv() and knots().
