//
//   - [InvalidArgument] (C++ std::invalid_argument): Nonpositive or nonfinite extent.
//   - [LengthError] (C++ std::length_error): Optional count cap or container capacity exceeded
//     before allocation.
//   - [AllocationError] (C++ std::bad_alloc): Allocation fails.
//
// It uses the C++ defaults seed = 20250728, extent = 1e+01, maxPoints = 1000000;
// [DelaunayUniformCloudWithSeed], [DelaunayUniformCloudWithExtent] and
// [DelaunayUniformCloudWithMaxPoints] pass more arguments.
//
// See also delaunay_trace().
