//   - knots: Finite, strictly increasing breakpoints in [lower, upper]. Boundary entries are
//     optional; an empty vector creates a basis without interior knots.
//   - degree: Polynomial degree, default 3 (cubic).
//   - intercept: Keep the first basis column, default false. Leave false with an intercept formula
//     such as `y ~ .`; use a no-intercept formula when true.
