//     multidimensional grids. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.csda.2004.07.008
//
// Parameters:
//
//   - bases: One basis per dimension.
//   - points: Sample locations, each of length bases.size().
//   - values: One response per point.
//   - lambdas: Nonnegative per-axis smoothing weights, one per basis.
//   - order: Difference order (default 2, the conventional curvature penalty).
